 "brief_title": "SMOOTH - Blood Pressure Control in Diabetic/Obese Patients",
 "official_title": "Prospective, Randomized, Open-label, Blinded Endpoint, Forced Titration Study to Compare Telmisartan Combined With HCTZ (80mg/12.5mg), to Valsartan Combined With HCTZ (160mg/12.5mg), for the Control of Mild-to-moderate Hypertension in Obese Patients With Type 2 Diabetes Mellitus Using ABPM.",
